Source SVGs for the gift catalogue, generated from the Figma page
"16 Gift Catalogue" (file KzjWYs64L1bPAmD6Bxoic2).

These are original artwork drawn for Zipper — no third-party licence attaches
to any of them. Regenerate from Figma rather than hand-editing.

For Android, convert to VectorDrawable:
    Android Studio > right-click res > New > Vector Asset > Local file
or in bulk with svg2vector / vd-tool.
